<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>确认入场与结构止损 · 顺序验证</title><style>
:root{--ink:#263545;--muted:#617387;--line:#dce4ec;--accent:#2563eb}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f3f6f9;color:var(--ink);font:15px/1.65 "Noto Sans CJK SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}main{max-width:1550px;margin:auto;padding:26px 34px}h1{font-size:27px;margin:4px 0 12px}h2{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 15px}p{margin:8px 0}section{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:22px 24px;margin:18px 0}.muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.notice{border-left:4px solid var(--accent);padding:10px 15px;background:#f1f6ff}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}.stat{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:14px}.stat strong{display:block;font-size:23px}.up{color:#aa4938}.down{color:#1d806c}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px}th,td{text-align:right;padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}th:first-child,td:first-child{text-align:left}th{font-weight:600;background:#f6f8fb}tr.focus{background:#f1f6ff}tr[data-uid]{cursor:pointer}tr[data-uid]:hover{background:#edf4ff}.scroll{overflow:auto}button,select{font:inherit;border:1px solid #ccd6e4;background:white;border-radius:7px;padding:7px 10px;color:var(--ink)}select{max-width:100%}button{cursor:pointer}button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default}button.active{background:#e7f0ff;border-color:#93b3ea}.controls{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:12px 0}select#tradeSelect{flex:1;min-width:320px}#chart{height:970px}#higher{height:680px}.details{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin:12px 0}.details div{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px}.details b{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.criteria{padding:12px 15px;background:#f6f8fb;margin:12px 0;border-radius:8px}@media(max-width:800px){main{padding:16px 10px}section{padding:16px 10px}.grid,.details{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:23px}th,td{white-space:nowrap}}
</style></head><body><main><div class="muted">离线研究 · 2026-10-07 · 预先固定规则、分别验证</div><h1>确认入场与五分钟结构止损</h1><p class="notice" id="recommendation"></p><p class="muted" id="sample"></p>
<section><h2>按顺序验证的结果</h2><div class="grid" id="stats"></div><div class="scroll"><table id="totals"></table></div><div class="criteria" id="selection"></div><p class="muted">净收益已扣手续费与每次成交1跳不利滑点。最大回撤显示各窗口中最大的资金回撤，窗口没有拼接为连续实盘账户。</p></section>
<section><h2>三个开发窗口</h2><div class="scroll"><table id="windows"></table></div><div id="evidence"></div></section>
<section><h2>为什么问题仍未解决</h2><p id="concentration"></p><p id="confirmationOutcome"></p><p id="structureOutcome"></p><p class="muted">下表按同一合约、方向及入场时间配对。点击一行查看结构止损的完整保护路径，再用“查看同一入场的原策略”比较。</p><div class="scroll"><table id="stopComparison"></table></div></section>
<section><h2>逐笔入场、退场及当时生效的保护</h2><p class="muted">K线以完成时间标记。空心圆为行情开盘或触发价；三角、叉号为计入不利滑点的模拟成交价。图中保留原有均线、量比、净增仓和平稳指标。</p><div class="controls"><select id="variant"></select><button id="prev">上一笔</button><button id="next">下一笔</button><button id="pair">查看同一入场的原策略</button></div><div class="controls"><select id="tradeSelect"></select><button data-view="local" class="active">入退场局部</button><button data-view="day">当天全段</button></div><h2 id="tradeTitle"></h2><div class="details" id="detail"></div><p id="entryExplanation"></p><p id="stopExplanation"></p><div id="chart"></div><details id="higherContext"><summary>查看信号时已完成的5／15分钟K线及结构来源</summary><div id="higher"></div></details></section>
<section id="caseSection"><h2>已确认但未成交的信号</h2><p class="muted">这些是实际回放中被拒绝或取消的确认信号，不计入成交和净收益。图中只标记形态确认与未成交报价。</p><select id="caseSelect"></select><p id="caseReason"></p><div id="caseChart"></div></section><section><h2>全部成交记录</h2><div class="scroll"><table id="tradeTable"></table></div></section><section><h2>验证依据</h2><p id="verification"></p><p class="muted">仅组合同时通过两个独立阶段的改动；失败方案保留记录，不在本轮继续调参数。研究规则没有部署到实盘。</p><details><summary>查看冻结规则</summary><p>确认入场：保留原通道；高周期资格通过后，突破前两根K线极值或确认资格之后的MA10回踩，再要求紧邻下一根K线收盘越过形态建立K线极值。原通道优先，资金、价格、成本和同日止损后禁入规则共用。</p><p>结构止损：当前连续时段内最近三根完成的5分钟K线，多单取最低点再减1跳，空单取最高点再加1跳；保留原距离下限。结构距离不超过信号时已知5分钟ATR的2倍，成交时重新核对，手数在原0.2%风险预算内重算。结构边界冻结；保本启动价按新的1R计算，追踪启动价按原盈亏比等比例换算，触发后继续采用2ATR追踪。</p></details></section></main><script>__PLOTLY__</script><script>
const D=__DATA__;window.reviewData=D;const A=D.assessment;let view='local',active=null;const fmt=n=>Number(n).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{minimumFractionDigits:2,maximumFractionDigits:2});const number=n=>Number(n).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{maximumFractionDigits:4});const esc=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));const money=n=>`<span class="${n>0?'up':n<0?'down':''}">${n>0?'+':''}${fmt(n)}</span>`;const channel={direct:'原通道',legacy:'原通道',confirmed_breakout:'突破延续确认',confirmed_pullback:'回踩延续确认'};const reasons={fixed_stop:'初始止损',breakeven_stop:'保本保护',trailing_stop:'追踪保护',volume:'放量走弱',ma40_cross:'MA40反向穿越',time_force:'时段强平',break_close:'休市前退出',session_close:'收盘退出'};const criteria={total_net_improves:'总净收益提高',each_window_net_not_worse:'每个窗口净收益不下降',each_window_drawdown_not_worse:'每个窗口回撤不扩大',without_best_trade_net_not_worse:'去掉最佳一笔后的收益不下降',minimum_trade_count:'交易数量达标',new_contract_day_directions:'至少新增一个合约／日期／方向机会',active_days_not_worse:'发生交易的天数不下降'};
document.querySelector('#recommendation').textContent=A.selected==='control'?'两项改动未通过预先设定的保留标准，继续保留当前7笔研究版。交易偏少和收益集中问题仍然存在。':`本轮选择：${D.labels[A.selected]}。这是开发窗口的诊断结果，仍需未见数据验证。`;
document.querySelector('#sample').textContent=`${A.research_days}个交易日。${D.sample_note}`;
const T=A.totals[A.selected];document.querySelector('#stats').innerHTML=`<div class="stat">本轮保留方案<strong>${esc(D.labels[A.selected])}</strong></div><div class="stat">扣费后净收益<strong>${money(T.net)} 元</strong></div><div class="stat">成交／活跃天数<strong>${T.trade_count}笔／${T.active_days}天</strong></div>`;
document.querySelector('#totals').innerHTML='<thead><tr><th>方案</th><th>成交</th><th>活跃天数</th><th>净收益（元）</th><th>最大窗口回撤（元）</th><th>去掉最佳一笔（元）</th><th>保留标准</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+Object.entries(A.totals).map(([v,t])=>`<tr class="${v===A.selected?'focus':''}"><td>${esc(D.labels[v])}</td><td>${t.trade_count}</td><td>${t.active_days}</td><td>${money(t.net)}</td><td>${fmt(t.max_window_drawdown)}</td><td>${money(t.without_best_trade)}</td><td>${v==='control'?'对照':A.promotion[v].passed?'通过':'未通过'}</td></tr>`).join('')+'</tbody>';
document.querySelector('#selection').innerHTML=Object.entries(A.promotion).map(([v,p])=>`<div><b>${esc(D.labels[v])}</b>：${p.passed?'全部通过':Object.entries(p.checks).filter(([k,val])=>!val).map(([k])=>esc(criteria[k]||k)).join('、')+'未达标'}。</div>`).join('')+`<div>组合验证：${A.combination_status==='not_eligible'?'独立阶段未同时通过，本轮不运行组合。':A.combination_status==='passed'?'通过。':'未通过。'}</div>`;
document.querySelector('#windows').innerHTML='<thead><tr><th>窗口</th><th>方案</th><th>成交</th><th>净收益（元）</th><th>最大回撤（元）</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+D.windows.slice().sort((a,b)=>a.month.localeCompare(b.month)||Object.keys(D.labels).indexOf(a.variant)-Object.keys(D.labels).indexOf(b.variant)).map(w=>`<tr><td>${w.month==='2026-09'?'9月14—23日':w.month}</td><td>${esc(D.labels[w.variant])}</td><td>${w.metrics.trade_count}</td><td>${money(w.metrics.net_profit)}</td><td>${fmt(w.metrics.max_drawdown)}</td></tr>`).join('')+'</tbody>';
document.querySelector('#evidence').innerHTML=D.stage_evidence.filter(e=>e.variant!=='control').map(e=>`<p class="muted">${e.month} · ${esc(D.labels[e.variant])}：${e.diagnostics.entry_trigger||0}次触发，${e.diagnostics.risk_rejected_triggers||0}次风险／资金拒绝，${e.diagnostics.actual_fill||0}次成交，${e.diagnostics.fill_cancellation_count||0}次成交前取消。${e.variant==='confirmation'?`完成价格延续确认${(e.pattern_counts.confirmed_breakout_confirmed||0)+(e.pattern_counts.confirmed_pullback_confirmed||0)}次。`:''}</p>`).join('');
const variant=document.querySelector('#variant'),select=document.querySelector('#tradeSelect');variant.innerHTML=Object.entries(D.labels).map(([v,label])=>`<option value="${v}">${esc(label)}</option>`).join('');variant.value=A.selected;
const E=D.failure_explanation,B=A.totals.control;document.querySelector('#concentration').textContent=`原策略在${A.research_days}个交易日只有${B.trade_count}笔成交，最佳一笔占总净收益的${fmt(E.best_trade_share_of_net*100)}%；去掉最佳两笔后为${fmt(B.without_two_best_trades)}元。原通道是过滤条件由不通过变为通过，单靠这一触发没有改善交易偏少及收益集中的问题。`;
document.querySelector('#confirmationOutcome').textContent=`价格延续确认：共${E.confirmed_patterns}次形态确认，新增通道实际成交${E.supplemental_fills}笔。`+D.unfilled_confirmations.map(c=>`${c.time.slice(0,10)} ${c.contract}：${c.reason}。`).join('');
const pairedStops=D.structure_comparison.filter(r=>r.after),stopRange=(rs,key)=>[Math.min(...rs.map(r=>r[key].stop_5m_atr)),Math.max(...rs.map(r=>r[key].stop_5m_atr))].map(fmt).join('—');document.querySelector('#structureOutcome').textContent=`结构止损：${E.structure_shared_entries}笔保留相同入场，初始距离由${stopRange(pairedStops,'before')}倍5分钟ATR变为${stopRange(pairedStops,'after')}倍，手数按原0.2%风险预算重算。保本与追踪启动价也随距离扩大，盈利回吐和亏损变化需要一起看。七月回撤由${fmt(D.windows.find(w=>w.variant==='control'&&w.month==='2026-07').metrics.max_drawdown)}元降至${fmt(D.windows.find(w=>w.variant==='structure'&&w.month==='2026-07').metrics.max_drawdown)}元，但该月净收益减少${fmt(-A.promotion.structure.windows.find(w=>w.month==='2026-07').net_delta)}元，未达到每个窗口收益不下降的要求。`;
document.querySelector('#stopComparison').innerHTML='<thead><tr><th>日期／合约</th><th>手数 原→新</th><th>止损／5分钟ATR 原→新</th><th>持有交易分钟 原→新</th><th>退场原因 原→新</th><th>原净收益（元）</th><th>新净收益（元）</th><th>变化（元）</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+D.structure_comparison.map(r=>{const b=r.before,t=r.after;return `<tr data-uid="${esc(t?.uid||b.uid)}"><td>${r.entry_time.slice(0,10)} ${esc(r.contract)} ${r.direction==='LONG'?'多':'空'}</td><td>${b.quantity}→${t?.quantity??'未成交'}</td><td>${fmt(b.stop_5m_atr)}→${t?fmt(t.stop_5m_atr):'—'}</td><td>${b.holding_minutes}→${t?.holding_minutes??'—'}</td><td>${reasons[b.exit_reason]||b.exit_reason}→${t?(reasons[t.exit_reason]||t.exit_reason):'未成交'}</td><td>${money(b.net_pnl)}</td><td>${t?money(t.net_pnl):'—'}</td><td>${money(r.net_delta)}</td></tr>`}).join('')+'</tbody>';
function eligible(){return D.charts.filter(c=>c.trade.variant===variant.value)}
function populate(uid){const list=eligible();select.innerHTML=list.map(c=>{const t=c.trade;return `<option value="${t.uid}">${t.entry_time.slice(0,10)} ${t.contract} ${t.direction==='LONG'?'多':'空'} · ${t.entry_time.slice(11,16)}—${t.exit_time.slice(11,16)} · ${fmt(t.net_pnl)}元 · ${channel[t.entry_channel]||t.entry_channel}</option>`}).join('');if(uid)select.value=uid;if(!select.value&&list.length)select.value=list[0].trade.uid;return render()}
async function render(){window.chartReady=false;const c=D.charts.find(c=>c.trade.uid===select.value);active=c;if(!c){document.querySelector('#tradeTitle').textContent='此方案没有成交';document.querySelector('#detail').innerHTML='';document.querySelector('#entryExplanation').textContent='';document.querySelector('#stopExplanation').textContent='';Plotly.purge('chart');Plotly.purge('higher');window.chartReady=true;return}const t=c.trade,idx=eligible().indexOf(c);document.querySelector('#prev').disabled=idx===0;document.querySelector('#next').disabled=idx===eligible().length-1;document.querySelector('#pair').disabled=!t.paired_uid;document.querySelector('#tradeTitle').textContent=`${t.contract} · ${t.direction==='LONG'?'做多':'做空'} · ${t.entry_time.slice(0,10)} · ${reasons[t.exit_reason]||t.exit_reason}`;document.querySelector('#detail').innerHTML=`<div><b>入场 → 退场</b>${t.entry_time.slice(11,19)} ${number(t.entry_price)} → ${t.exit_time.slice(11,19)} ${number(t.exit_price)}</div><div><b>手数／持有交易分钟／净收益</b>${t.quantity}手 · ${t.holding_minutes}分钟 · ${money(t.net_pnl)}元</div><div><b>初始止损／5分钟ATR倍数</b>${number(t.stop_price)} · ${fmt(t.stop_5m_atr)}倍 · ${channel[t.entry_channel]||t.entry_channel}</div>`;document.querySelector('#entryExplanation').textContent=c.entry_explanation;document.querySelector('#stopExplanation').textContent=c.initial_stop_explanation;document.querySelectorAll('[data-view]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.view===view));await Plotly.react('chart',c.views[view].figure.data,c.views[view].figure.layout,{responsive:true,displaylogo:false});await Plotly.react('higher',c.higher_figure.data,c.higher_figure.layout,{responsive:true,displaylogo:false});window.chartReady=true;}
variant.addEventListener('change',()=>populate());select.addEventListener('change',render);document.querySelector('#prev').onclick=()=>{select.selectedIndex--;render()};document.querySelector('#next').onclick=()=>{select.selectedIndex++;render()};document.querySelector('#pair').onclick=()=>{variant.value='control';populate(active.trade.paired_uid)};document.querySelectorAll('[data-view]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{view=b.dataset.view;render()});document.querySelector('#higherContext').addEventListener('toggle',()=>{if(document.querySelector('#higherContext').open)Plotly.Plots.resize('higher')});
document.querySelector('#tradeTable').innerHTML='<thead><tr><th>方案／合约</th><th>日期</th><th>方向</th><th>入场</th><th>退场</th><th>手数</th><th>退场原因</th><th>净收益（元）</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+D.charts.map(c=>{const t=c.trade;return `<tr data-uid="${t.uid}"><td>${esc(D.labels[t.variant])} · ${t.contract}</td><td>${t.entry_time.slice(0,10)}</td><td>${t.direction==='LONG'?'多':'空'}</td><td>${t.entry_time.slice(11,16)} ${number(t.entry_price)}</td><td>${t.exit_time.slice(11,16)} ${number(t.exit_price)}</td><td>${t.quantity}</td><td>${reasons[t.exit_reason]||t.exit_reason}</td><td>${money(t.net_pnl)}</td></tr>`}).join('')+'</tbody>';document.querySelectorAll('[data-uid]').forEach(row=>row.onclick=()=>{const c=D.charts.find(c=>c.trade.uid===row.dataset.uid);variant.value=c.trade.variant;populate(row.dataset.uid);document.querySelector('#tradeTitle').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})});const caseSelect=document.querySelector('#caseSelect'); const cases=D.unfilled_confirmations; window.caseReady=false; async function renderCase(){window.caseReady=false;const c=cases.find(c=>c.uid===caseSelect.value);if(!c){document.querySelector('#caseSection').hidden=true;window.caseReady=true;return}document.querySelector('#caseReason').textContent=c.reason;await Plotly.react('caseChart',c.figure.data,c.figure.layout,{responsive:true,displaylogo:false});window.caseReady=true;} caseSelect.innerHTML=cases.map(c=>`<option value="${esc(c.uid)}">${c.time.slice(0,10)} ${c.time.slice(11,16)} · ${c.contract} · ${channel[c.channel]}</option>`).join('');caseSelect.addEventListener('change',renderCase);renderCase();document.querySelector('#verification').textContent=`${D.verification.sources.length}个有效回放全部通过独立核验，${D.charts.length}笔版本成交均可逐笔查看；核验包括原始行情、完成K线、入退场价格、手续费、风险预算和完整保护路径。三个原策略对照的10份交易／信号／资金及排名记录逐字节一致。`;populate();
</script></body></html>
